  "contracts": {
    "source_facts": "Current-variant roots, provider identity and Java class presentation facts must be supplied by an authoritative producer. Unattributed means known absence; Unknown aborts projection. This component annotates a whole root with one provider; faithful overlapping-root behavior still needs per-entry ordered provider facts or equivalent pure lookup.",
    "file_facts": "Immutable absolute physical-file/directory inventory bound to a model revision. Conflicting facts abort; nonexistent roots are omitted. No per-render disk I/O.",
    "identities": "Module/source group keys and physical occurrence keys with source-root identity; merged resource variants retain unique physical-path keys. Arena IDs are snapshot-local.",
    "presentation": "Rendered labels and gray annotations are separate from reference toTestString labels. Main annotations are omitted visually and retained in source/manifest reference labels.",
    "navigation": "Leaf targets preserve physical paths and supplied class offsets. Resource group best-target selection is unavailable until qualifier semantics exist.",
    "determinism": "Ordered indexes and UTF-16 presentation sorting; resource qualifier order and platform PSI presentation are not claimed equivalent. Root ties use physical-path order, not upstream Set insertion order; a later authoritative root-order adapter is required for exact ties."
  },
  "remaining_product_wiring": [
    "Integrate evaluated assets/source-provider catalog after lead validation; configured source-set iteration includes inactive providers and cannot establish Android Studio active overlay order.",
    "Extend typed projection inputs with authoritative per-directory/file provider selection and explicit source-root encounter order; do not treat constant root annotations or physical-path tie ordering as complete reference behavior.",
    "Adapt the current variant model and physical file snapshot on a background executor; bind revisions and reject stale results before publication; preserve the last successful tree after sync failure.",
    "Install the GPUI Android/filesystem selector and virtual-row rendering, icons, expansion/selection persistence, keyboard shortcuts, physical entry mapping and file/class navigation.",
    "Integrate durable view settings, local notifications, file refresh and generated-root updates; persist migrated preferences before cleanup and publish after durability.",
    "Port all five complete original cases using real Gradle import and every original assertion, then add applicable UI/live evidence.",
    "Implement resource FolderConfiguration comparison and best qualified resource navigation; define PSI-equivalent multi-class presentation when Rust language metadata is available.",
    "Add remaining AndroidSourceType groups, build-script/dependency nodes and non-Android/included-build module behavior; this component only exposes the documented source-group subset."
  ],
